WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.600
From Warrior I or a high lunge, shift your weight fully into the front foot.

2
00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:03.200
Hinge forward from the hips as the back leg lifts behind you.

3
00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:04.800
Reach the arms forward or alongside the body, lengthening from fingertips to lifted heel.

4
00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:06.400
Level the hips and float toward a T-shape parallel to the floor.

5
00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:08.000
Fix your gaze on one still point, hold, then switch sides.
